--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE

The BSD-2-Clause licence above covers the code in this repository: src/,
pipeline/, notebooks/ and integrations-test/.

The datasets and models this code produces are published separately and carry
their own terms, set out below.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA

The training data derives from SPRING_INX Tamil R1, SPRING Lab, Indian
Institute of Technology Madras, released under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0).

  https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.14654

The derived dataset carries the same licence and the same attribution:

  https://huggingface.co/datasets/santhosh-005/tamil-eot   (CC BY 4.0)

The audio itself is not redistributed in this repository. It has to be obtained
from SPRING Lab; see src/tamileot/paths.py.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MODELS

  https://huggingface.co/santhosh-005/smart-turn-tamil     (BSD-2-Clause)

Fine-tunes of pipecat-ai/smart-turn (BSD-2-Clause, Daily), trained on data
derived from SPRING_INX Tamil R1 (CC BY 4.0). Not distributed in this
repository.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

  models/mel_filters.npz
  The 80-band mel filterbank from OpenAI Whisper, used unmodified so that
  feature extraction matches the model's training-time features exactly.
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI. https://github.com/openai/whisper

Weights fetched by pipeline/00_fetch_models.py are not redistributed here:

  silero_vad.onnx            Silero VAD v5, MIT, https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
  smart-turn-v3.*.onnx       BSD-2-Clause, https://github.com/pipecat-ai/smart-turn
